00:11:45.170 --> 00:11:46.438
Can -- Wait a minute.

00:11:46.438 --> 00:11:50.542
Can everybody please
just speak once at a time?

00:11:50.542 --> 00:11:51.810
-Yeah.
[ Indistinct shouting ]

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:54.346
-2? 2.
-So, here we go.

00:11:54.346 --> 00:11:55.447
-Okay.
-I'm hot.

00:11:55.447 --> 00:11:57.148
-I got to get to 2.
-You can't get me.

00:11:57.148 --> 00:11:59.985
I'm hot, man! I'm hot!

00:11:59.985 --> 00:12:02.187
Ow-wah!
Oh, it's really heavy.

00:12:02.187 --> 00:12:05.490
Oh, my God. Oh, my goodness.
It's really so heavy.

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:07.526
Oh, look at how
exhausted you are.

00:12:07.526 --> 00:12:09.628
Oh, my God.
-Actually, it's quite light.

00:12:09.628 --> 00:12:10.696
-Oh, it is.
-Okay.

00:12:10.696 --> 00:12:13.031
-Oh, it's light? Okay. Wow.

00:12:13.031 --> 00:12:16.235
Now, I don't know if
that was a lie or true.

00:12:16.235 --> 00:12:18.738
Okay. Okay.

00:12:26.745 --> 00:12:28.547
How are you? Everything good?

00:12:28.547 --> 00:12:32.050
-Are you familiar
with something...

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:33.819
-This is how you play the game?

00:12:33.819 --> 00:12:35.988
Am I familiar with a closet?
Yes.

00:12:35.988 --> 00:12:39.525
-Something called a paintbrush?
-Yes, of course.

00:12:39.525 --> 00:12:40.826
-Okay.

00:12:40.826 --> 00:12:43.596
And...
[ Laughs ]

00:12:43.596 --> 00:12:47.165
And have you
ever braided your hair?

00:12:47.165 --> 00:12:50.569
Or your wife's hair
or your daughter's hair?

00:12:50.569 --> 00:12:51.770
-Yes.

00:12:51.770 --> 00:12:58.043
-Okay, so, what this is
a paintbrush of hair

00:12:58.043 --> 00:13:02.314
that's been braided with --

00:13:02.314 --> 00:13:03.782
What do you call that thing?

00:13:03.782 --> 00:13:06.718
A ponytail holder at the end.

00:13:06.718 --> 00:13:09.822
-Like, a scrunchie?
-No, it's not.

00:13:09.822 --> 00:13:13.291
I said it's a ponytail holder.
Come on. Let's go.

00:13:13.291 --> 00:13:15.627
-What's a ponytail holder?
I've never even heard of that.

00:13:15.627 --> 00:13:16.728
Why didn't you say,

00:13:16.728 --> 00:13:18.730
"Are you familiar
with ponytail holders?"

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:20.666
I'm not.
-You are not.

00:13:20.666 --> 00:13:21.700
-I am not.
I have no idea what that means.

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:23.034
A ponytail holder?

00:13:23.034 --> 00:13:26.104
-Well, it's like a thinner thing
that's not a scrunchie.

00:13:26.104 --> 00:13:29.274
-A rubber band?
A rubber band?

00:13:29.274 --> 00:13:31.476
-No, a ponytail holder.

00:13:31.476 --> 00:13:34.413
A rubber band is made of rubber
and can tear your hair.

00:13:34.413 --> 00:13:36.748
This is a ponytail holder.
-Made of fabric.

00:13:36.748 --> 00:13:40.753
-It's also --
There's paint on it and also...

00:13:40.753 --> 00:13:44.423
[ Laughter ]
I love this game.

00:13:44.423 --> 00:13:45.757
Can I come back
and play again tomorrow?

00:13:45.757 --> 00:13:50.462
-This is unbelievable.
Okay. Gosh.

00:13:50.462 --> 00:13:54.733
-By all means, take your time.

00:13:54.733 --> 00:13:58.837
-I'm going to say...you lie.

00:13:58.837 --> 00:14:00.205
-Whoo!
-Oh, it worked!

00:14:00.205 --> 00:14:02.074
[ Dinging ]

00:14:02.074 --> 00:14:06.011
Oh, come on!

00:14:06.011 --> 00:14:08.280
I was like,
"That's too descriptive.

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:09.514
That's too good."

00:14:09.514 --> 00:14:11.050
Julia Louis-Dreyfus, everybody!

